<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S1.F1.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S1.F1.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Orchestrator Cell Design. A reprint is available in Appendix <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Orchestrator Cell Architecture Overview ‣ Appendix A Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material ‣ Orchestrator: Active Inference for Multi-Agent Systems in Long-Horizon Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
